    "impact_reason": "The integrated implementation adds feature_delivery_view and _retained_feature_delivery Function nodes and shared Workspace-to-Boss delivery relationships. Boss separates active from published repair generations and requires accepted current-generation intended-Epic ancestry; Workspace retains nonterminal owners, advances idle cursors under the graph lock, resumes admitted or interrupted work, and rechecks terminal delivery before retirement. Root/package/Boss/Workspace designs and normal/failure/restart flows match source. Context and container boundaries are unchanged. Source-contract checks, all rendered source kinds/component ownership, actual context-to-Code navigation, deep links, pinned source, Level up and warm artifact reuse passed for the committed integrated model. This is a reviewed material implementation proposal, not a retry of the failed baseline publication; prior receipts and accepted snapshots are unchanged."
